dex":"002","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞أَتَأۡمُرُونَ ٱلنَّاسَ بِٱلۡبِرِّ وَتَنسَوۡنَ أَنفُسَكُمۡ وَأَنتُمۡ تَتۡلُونَ ٱلۡكِتَٰبَۚ أَفَلَا تَعۡقِلُونَ","TajweedText":"۞ أَتَأْمُرُونَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبِرِّ وَتَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نس</tajweed>َوْنَ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نف</tajweed>ُسَكُمْ وَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَتْلُونَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكِتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بَ‌ۚ أَفَلَا تَعْقِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":6,"MaqraNumber":3,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱسۡتَعِينُواْ بِٱلصَّبۡرِ وَٱلصَّلَوٰةِۚ وَإِنَّهَا لَكَبِيرَةٌ إِلَّا عَلَى ٱلۡخَٰشِعِينَ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>سْتَعِينُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>رِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّلَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةِ‌ۚ وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهَا لَكَبِيرَةٌ إِلَّا عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْخَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>شِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":7,"JuzNumber":1,"ManzilNumber":1,"RukuNumber":6,"MaqraNumber":3,"HizbNumber":1,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":2,"SurahIndex":"002","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَظُنُّونَ أَنَّهُم مُّلَٰقُواْ رَبِّهِمۡ وَأَنَّهُمۡ إِلَيۡهِ رَٰجِعُونَ","TajweedText":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَظُ<tajwe